  },
  {
    "episode_id": 64553,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/6/4/64553.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 5,
    "turn_text": "Good. That's not nearly enough. And when I say not enough, I just think it's actually true that we are more at risk today from external threats than we were when we walked out in January of 2021. There's a war in Europe. We had a Chinese balloon fly over our country, our southern border is porous. These are the tip of the iceberg in terms of risk, and the Biden administration has made decisions that allowed each of these to happen.",
