        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "A rambunctious press is expected and historically normal in America.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The Republic may not survive for another 250 years.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The New York Times did not issue corrections or acknowledgments regarding the false reporting on the Russia hoax.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The New York Times reported on the Russia hoax for two years despite knowing parts were false.",
