    "turn_idx": 26,
    "turn_text": "You better damn well know who you are. If there's one thing that's important, you can build teams, you can find subject matter experts. You better have the character and the spine of steel necessary to lead the most important nation in the world forward. Someone who is fiscally serious, both parties have spent too much money, including my own party, including my own administration spent too much money. That is hard work to convince the American people that the things that they're getting from the federal government need to be different. You better know who you are because both the opportunity and the power that come from that office will break people who don't understand the things that they value. And if you haven't had a consistent history of demonstrating that over time, you'll get website inside of that place. And so someone who's prepared to speak the truth, who is serious, who doesn't spend their whole day trying to own the lives, but rather is making arguments about the things that will deliver good outcomes for every American. That's who I hope the American people will latch onto. Whoever that may be.",
